          "body": "Brand mapping updates an item's `tenant_id` before `_rehome` updates its `task_id`, as the new brand-mapping integration test demonstrates. This query authorizes only the task and then returns every attached item, including items whose brand no longer matches it. During that interval, the old task's owners and collaborators retain access to the remapped item's details and comments. The item mutation endpoints likewise check attachment alone. Enforce current item/task brand agreement on reads and writes, or move the attachment atomically with the brand change; the separate task pass must not be the authorization boundary.",
